0C7"}, {"file_name": "Untitled-5.png", "id": "1563122734096448", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75230044_1563122737429781_4826929505904444582_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SpZ8gW2Pn5wQ7kNvwHWwzkX&_nc_oc=AdprhHOog1BxnurNoIKlmZoPNrP2A3Wy0uFfOHgyr6KhnlQ0YEQMLjkv0qPwQQc8UbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE7YxUHPykDJ3l-XbN-LKxqqNnE7WgZzRbEa1IurPREfA&oe=6A8044FF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "DMQ_Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "1640105473176745", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031402_1640105476510078_9052484158633082271_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l8KsTPtvpZgQ7kNvwFmBus_&_nc_oc=AdrnLUpY_UDk-wO_omQvygfmUxG-doheApTJv3mbHtHenFZp__hqaJ5-dRUu-G6sl94&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH2iyAAkaabm3ECN9ZIGIthnBL0KFodq4G-BzJc6QWGGA&oe=6A80482D"}, "display_name": "Dead Man's Quest", "keywords": ["Narrative", "Pirate", "Puzzle", "F2P"], "long_description": "Hey, you! Welcome to the island of Pequena! \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Dead Man's Quest is a narrative hand-tracking and puzzle short story and technical demonstration, lovingly wrapped in a light-hearted and quirky pirate theme \ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f! \n\nWith its carefree, comical, and visually exaggerated style, Dead Man's Quest features colorful characters, a perky parrot \ud83e\udd9c and quippy narrated dialogue. With hand-tracking controls, you embody an... well, unusual character in a precarious situation as you wake up in a holding cell in the Fort. Did we mention you need to solve some puzzles to escape? \n\nDead Man's Quest is the result of the developers' exploration into hand-tracking technologies and their love for games such as \u201cMonkey Island\u201d and movies such as \u201cLife of Brian\u201d. The experience is not intended as a full game. We hope you enjoy it! \n\nNote that the experience is meant to be play